    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "25 Chapel Street is in the heart of Balbriggan and enjoys a highly convenient town-centre location within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities. Balbriggan is a vibrant and growing coastal town that offers an appealing blend of seaside living, community atmosphere and excellent everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe area benefits from a variety of recreational and leisure amenities all within easy reach. Residents are just a short walk from Balbriggan Beach and the picturesque harbour area, providing scenic coastal walks and outdoor leisure opportunities. Nearby parks, sports clubs and gyms , while the town centre offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and local shops. Connectivity is a key advantage of this location. Balbriggan railway station is within a short walk and provides regular commuter rail and DART services to Dublin city centre and surrounding coastal areas. The town is also well served by Dublin Bus and Bus Éireann routes, while the nearby M1 Motorway offers excellent road access to Dublin Airport, the city centre and the wider north-east region."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The property opens into a a spacious living area with wooden flooring throughout, the room is centred around a cast iron stove that creates a warm and cosy focal point. Large windows on either side of the room keep the room airy and bright. Adjacent to the living area is the fully fitted kitchen that over looks the back garden. Finished with tiled flooring and wooden counter tops the kitchen has plenty of above and under head storage as well as all modern appliances for convienence. From the kitchen, doors open onto a wonderful outdoor space with excellent potential for entertaining guests or enjoying a relaxing evening. The ground floor is complete with a guest WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the carpet-lined staircase leads to two generous double bedrooms along with the main upstairs bathroom. Each bedroom is well proportioned and have large windows flooding the rooms with natural light. The upstairs bathroom is well-appointed and benefits from shower facilities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E1"
      }
